{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664350/extras/Wishlist.gif?t=1746624611\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>&quot;Dig Harder Deal Smarter...&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dig and Deal</strong> is a <strong>digging</strong> and <strong>trading</strong> simulator where you run your own shop by selling the treasures you uncover underground. <strong>Dig, explore, collect valuable items, and make deals with your customers to grow your fortune!</strong> Buy better tools, dig deeper, discover rarer loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo contains limited content compared to the full game. Some features, items, maps, and questlines will be expanded in the full release but you can still dig, trade, decorate your shop, and take on small quests in this version.\u00a0Please note that this demo includes fewer collectible items, fewer shop decorations, and only one playable map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664350/extras/dig.png?t=1746624611\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664350/extras/dig.gif?t=1746624611\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dig the terrain, find valuable items, upgrade your equipment, and dig even deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664350/extras/bargain.png?t=1746624611\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664350/extras/bargain.gif?t=1746624611\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Negotiate prices</strong> with customers to get the <strong>best possible deals.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664350/extras/quest.png?t=1746624611\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664350/extras/quest.gif?t=1746624611\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some customers will offer <strong>unique quests</strong> with <strong>special rewards.</strong> Complete them to earn extra cash and uncover their stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664350/extras/shop.png?t=1746624611\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664350/extras/shop.gif?t=1746624611\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Decorate and upgrade your shop</strong> with furniture and props to improve its look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664350/extras/discord.png?t=1746624611\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3664350?t=1746624611","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3664350?t=1746624611","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664350/f486a35a15fee53d4b3a1ccfcab985a957290425/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746624611","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664350/f486a35a15fee53d4b3a1ccfcab985a957290425/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746624611","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids"